{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"一种比前面更轻快、舒展，甚至带着几分庆祝意味的投入出现了；它不是重新获得了完整的确定，而是在真实的满足里暂时少了那种非要把整件事安顿好的压力。与此同时，这份愉快一直有些蒙着阴影：它可以真切地成立，中间甚至重新变得明亮，却又会被不安侵入。\",\"thread\":\"前面已经实际知道，这个回答确实给了人重要的东西，只是不能承担全部。正因为它的限度已经显出来，这里反而不必再逼它证明“整件事已经解决”，于是它真正能给的满足可以更自由、更充分地被接受，轻快和昂扬因此并不虚假。可未被它安顿的部分也没有消失，所以人越能享受这份真实的满足，就越无法把满足本身误认成圆满；愉快与阴影因此可以同时成立，而不需要互相否定。\",\"used\":\"第2段已经确认：这种回答并非自我安慰，确实能够使人相信和投入；同时也已经确认，它只能安顿一部分所求，充分经历以后，剩下的部分反而更清楚。\",\"new\":[\"知道一种回答并不完整，并不会取消它已经真实给予的满足；人可以不再要求它解决全部，却仍然充分接受它有效的部分。\",\"真实的满足与仍未解决的不安可以同时存在；前者不再足以证明一切已经安顿，后者也不必把前者判成虚假。\"],\"unexplained\":\"还不能仅凭这条理解说明，为什么这一段后半的不安会逐渐变得更明显、更有阴影，而不只是一直维持在轻快而有所保留的状态。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c338a066-328a-432d-a97b-686646965af0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215946111456Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.985, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:00:37.108717+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7f7aa595127b73e487d3432adc39750c10457942d7a034e4ed4c49ecfb953eb7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215946111456Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b48a0daef86efa79b487a0c5d47bd1c7587e3b3f6ddd0fa46a98c049420e5f23"}}}
